{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act53side", "eventName": "直到大地变成一颗酸橙", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "TO-ST-3", "avgTag": "幕间", "storyName": "祝好 终途的我", "storyInfo": "旅程已经结束，但她们在雷姆必拓留下的故事仍在继续。又回到了大涌泉镇，不在温泉里玩玩怎么能行呢？", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "image", "attributes": {"image": "cg_letter", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g13_worldend", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$holiday_intro", "key": "$holiday_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.6, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_paper2"}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "text": "给博士：", "x": 200.0, "y": 220.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st2", "text": "\\n我之前其实......没想过要给你写信的。", "multi": "true", "x": 200.0, "y": 260.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 900.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st2", "text": "\\n我是罗德岛的信使，无论在外漂泊多久，我最终都会回去，所以，为什么要给你写信呢？", "multi": "true", "x": 200.0, "y": 260.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 900.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st2", "text": "\\n但我仍然在一踏上回程旅途，从雷姆必拓的南境开始返回终极大铁屯的时刻，就开始给你写这封信了。", "multi": "true", "x": 200.0, "y": 260.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 900.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st2", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st2", "text": "\\n去程的事情，我会在行动记录中事无巨细地提及，所以不用担心读不懂......", "multi": "true", "x": 200.0, "y": 260.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 900.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st2", "text": "\\n......可是这样想来，回程的事不也会写在行动记录里面吗？", "multi": "true", "x": 200.0, "y": 260.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 900.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st2", "text": "\\n但我仍然要给你写这封信。因为这趟旅程——无论去程还是回程——都是一段太过愉快的经历，愉快到让人感到遗憾......", "multi": "true", "x": 200.0, "y": 260.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 900.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st2", "text": "\\n......为你不在我们身边而遗憾。", "multi": "true", "x": 200.0, "y": 260.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 900.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_deluxeroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$RimBillitonDaily_intro", "key": "$RimBillitonDaily_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_329_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_020", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先生和夫人在衣帽间里待了多久了？", "name": "悲观的保镖"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_020"}, {"id": 37, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "急什么。无非又是和核心圈诸国的贸易代表开会而已。", "name": "乐天的司机"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_329_1#1$1"}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "反正这场会没有坎贝尔夫妇就开不起来，先生和夫人愿意拖就拖着呗，说不定也是谈判策略呢。", "name": "乐天的司机"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_329_1#1$1"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可我听说那些贸易代表已经开始私下建立攻守同盟了，情况可能没我们想象得那么乐观......", "name": "悲观的保镖"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_020"}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......我去挑一条领带，好不好......", "name": "衣帽间里的男声"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这条动物的实在是......", "name": "衣帽间里的男声"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看，还挑领带呢，根本就不着急。", "name": "乐天的司机"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_329_1#1$1"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "动物图案的？先生从来没打过动物图案的领带，该不会是某种暗号......情况有变？", "name": "悲观的保镖"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_020"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......她当年就想看你系这条领带，你当时也是用这句话把她打发了......", "name": "衣帽间里的女声"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“她”？", "name": "乐天的司机"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_329_1#1$1"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“当年”？", "name": "悲观的保镖"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_020"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "乐天的司机和悲观的保镖都不说话了。两人虽然没有离开原位，却都竖起了耳朵，使劲捕捉衣帽间里传来的每一丝语音。"}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......可你至少也在外面给我留点面子......", "name": "衣帽间里的男声"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_020"}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......这件事不解释清楚，就别怪我一点面子都不给你！", "name": "衣帽间里的女声"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_020"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我会道歉的，我真的会道歉的，但这条动物领带还是——", "name": "衣帽间里的男声"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_020"}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好好好......", "name": "衣帽间里的男声"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_020"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$dooropenquite"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_329_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_020", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先生、夫人！如果都准备好了，我们就前往大铁屯会议中心——", "name": "悲观的保镖"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_020"}, {"id": 69, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大铁屯会议中心？", "name": "优雅的夫人"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不、不是吗？", "name": "悲观的保镖"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_020"}, {"id": 73, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "夫人，恕我直言，就算这次的贸易代表里有，呃，跟先生之前有因缘的人，也不好因私废公——", "name": "乐天的司机"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_329_1#1$1"}, {"id": 75, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊？我们要去看嘉辛塔和她的朋友们，你们在说什么？", "name": "严厉的先生"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘉辛塔？那这条领带......", "name": "乐天的司机"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_329_1#1$1"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他第一次送嘉辛塔去疗养院之前，嘉辛塔就想看他系这条领带，结果他用一句“太不庄重”把嘉辛塔打发了。", "name": "优雅的夫人"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "之前嘉辛塔在大铁屯的事迹你们想必也听说了，利亚姆·坎贝尔接下来要去给他的女儿接风，顺带道歉。", "name": "优雅的夫人"}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原来是这样......", "name": "悲观的保镖"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_020"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "现在，先生们，轮到你们向我解释，刚刚那些“有因缘的人”“因私废公”是什么意思了。", "name": "优雅的夫人"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g5_sunvalleycom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2362_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "爸爸爸爸，那个柜子上是不是多了什么东西呀？", "name": "活泼的女孩"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2362_1#1$1"}, {"id": 96, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2354_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就数你眼尖。那是今年击球大赛的照片，要我给你取下来看看吗？", "name": "愉快的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2354_1#1$1"}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2362_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好呀！", "name": "活泼的女孩"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2362_1#2$1"}, {"id": 100, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_close_glasscabinet"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2362_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "照片上是......四个穿得很漂亮的姐姐？", "name": "活泼的女孩"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2362_1#1$1"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "爸爸，她们为什么不穿工服呀？", "name": "活泼的女孩"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2362_1#1$1"}, {"id": 107, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2354_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因为她们本来也不是太阳谷的矿工，她们是来帮忙修通讯塔，顺带参加击球大赛的。", "name": "愉快的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2354_1#1$1"}, {"id": 109, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2362_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那通讯塔修好了吗？", "name": "活泼的女孩"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2362_1#1$1"}, {"id": 111, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2354_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "修好了呀。不光修好了，她们还在矿井下面救了个人出来呢。", "name": "愉快的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2354_1#1$1"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2362_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "姐姐们太了不起了！那她们击球大赛得了第几名呀？她们得了冠军吗？", "name": "活泼的女孩"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2362_1#2$1"}, {"id": 115, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2354_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哼哼......修塔和救人先不说，要在击球场上击败你爸爸我？她们还嫩着呢！", "name": "愉快的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2354_1#1$1"}, {"id": 117, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_close_glasscabinet"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2354_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这才是今年的冠军奖杯，爸爸赢过来的！怎么样，好不好看？想不想要？", "name": "愉快的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2354_1#4$1"}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2362_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "爸爸坏！爸爸不让姐姐们得冠军！", "name": "活泼的女孩"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2362_1#3$1"}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2354_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不是，这是比赛——", "name": "愉快的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2354_1#1$1"}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2362_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我要这张照片嘛！", "name": "活泼的女孩"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2362_1#3$1"}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2354_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小祖宗你等等，可别把照片弄坏了。我去问问胶卷在谁手里，什么时候再洗一张......", "name": "愉快的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2354_1#1$1"}, {"id": 132, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "刚刚塔妮她们来了，要找大家聚一聚，参加了击球大赛的人都去了，就差你一个人啦。", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2354_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这不是巧了吗？走走走，爸爸带你找姐姐们合影去！", "name": "愉快的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2354_1#3$1"}, {"id": 140, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "说起来，其他人还问联络员先生在不在呢。", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2354_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他？他可能去不了吧。通讯塔修好之后他出去跑生意，好像真的出了场不大不小的车祸，回总部疗养来了。", "name": "愉快的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2354_1#1$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$dooropenquite"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2363_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2363_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "巴顿先生在吗？我好得差不多了，可不可以结束疗养——", "name": "太阳谷联络员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2363_1#4$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2362_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呀，联络员先生！", "name": "活泼的女孩"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2362_1#2$1"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2354_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2363_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔，你好了呀。走，我们一起！", "name": "愉快的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2354_1#3$1"}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2363_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一、一起去干嘛？！", "name": "太阳谷联络员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2363_1#5$1"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2362_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "参加击球大赛的人都去了，联络员叔叔也去！", "name": "活泼的女孩"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2363_1#5$1"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2354_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2363_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "击球大赛？！", "name": "太阳谷联络员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2363_1#6$1"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2363_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哎呦呦呦呦呦呦呦......", "name": "太阳谷联络员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2363_1#2$1"}, {"id": 169, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "31_g4_mini12_village", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$path_n_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2355_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5, "posfrom": "-100,0", "posto": "-100,0"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2355_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5, "posfrom": "100,0", "posto": "100,0"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2359_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2359_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喝了这么多天，每次喝你们的胡萝卜酿我都在想，你们这儿的胡萝卜是真好。", "name": "塔妮父亲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2359_1#1$1"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可不是嘛。糖度高，不爱坏，风味好......拿来晾胡萝卜干也太可惜了！", "name": "巴尼特"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2355_1#1$1"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这不是村里没那么多能喝酒的人嘛！", "name": "好事的村民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2355_1#1$1"}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "正巧我还想问你们呢，你们大涌泉镇缺不缺胡萝卜酿？要是能互通有无——", "name": "好事的村民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2355_1#1$1"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2359_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这么好的胡萝卜酿，雷姆必拓哪里不缺？", "name": "塔妮父亲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2359_1#1$1"}, {"id": 191, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$clink"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.2, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 5.0, "vibrato": 10.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2355_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好！太好了！喝！", "name": "好事的村民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2355_1#1$1"}, {"id": 195, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2355_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喝！", "name": "巴尼特"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2355_1#1$1"}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2359_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喝——", "name": "塔妮父亲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2359_1#1$1"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2360_1#5$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "停！", "name": "塔妮母亲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2360_1#5$1"}, {"id": 204, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2359_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "麦迪森，生意谈到一半，马上就好，就一小会儿——", "name": "塔妮父亲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2359_1#4$1"}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2360_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "生意？和塔妮一起来的三个小姑娘已经把生意谈好啦。", "name": "塔妮母亲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2360_1#3$1"}, {"id": 208, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2359_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "连这都比我快一步？！", "name": "塔妮父亲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2359_1#3$1"}, {"id": 210, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2360_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一周前坎贝尔家的小姑娘就已经联系了附近的冰淇淋工厂，洋蓟村的特产就要变成胡萝卜筒冰淇淋了。", "name": "塔妮母亲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2360_1#1$1"}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "现在胡萝卜筒冰淇淋的试产已经完成，她们已经先上路啦。", "name": "塔妮母亲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2360_1#1$1"}, {"id": 213, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2359_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊？那我让塔妮带的照片？", "name": "塔妮父亲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2359_1#4$1"}, {"id": 215, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2360_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等你回家才能看到了！走了！", "name": "塔妮母亲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2360_1#5$1"}, {"id": 217, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2359_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你别揪我耳朵——我妈当年就是老揪我耳朵，才把我耳朵揪这么长的！我一直觉得我妈的短耳朵好——", "name": "塔妮父亲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2359_1#3$1"}, {"id": 219, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2360_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你耳朵哪里长了？你们仨的耳朵都是一个模子刻出来的！", "name": "塔妮母亲"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2360_1#3$1"}, {"id": 221, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g4_dailytown", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_mictest"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"maskid": "group_interclude_vertical_common", "size": "290,760", "style": 0.0, "offset": "0,0", "channel": 3.0, "tsfrom": "0,1", "tsto": "1,1", "tsduration": 0.5}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true", "pfrom": "50,0", "pto": "50,0", "name": "avg_npc_2347_1#1$1", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "特大喜讯，特大喜讯！", "name": "乌露露"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "经由阿梅利亚小姐的修理，大涌泉镇的远程通讯现已恢复！", "name": "乌露露"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因此，现在由本人，“引领者”乌露露，经由“泰拉重生之后”电台，给大涌泉镇的各位带来一则特大喜讯！", "name": "乌露露"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "clear": "true"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哇，乌露露的声音还是这么大......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1"}, {"id": 242, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我、我其实已经按你说的，偷偷调过她电台的音量了，根本没用，为什么啊......", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#5$1"}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2345_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因为这样一来她就会以为是自己声音不够大了。", "name": "玛蒂娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2345_1#1$1"}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不愧是玛蒂娜女士......我根本没想到这一点......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1"}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$2"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呜哇，温泉都震起波纹了......", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$2"}, {"id": 250, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"maskid": "group_interclude_vertical_common", "size": "290,760", "style": 0.0, "offset": "0,0", "channel": 3.0, "tsfrom": "0,1", "tsto": "1,1", "tsduration": 0.0}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true", "pfrom": "50,0", "pto": "50,0", "name": "avg_npc_2347_1#1$1", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "为了庆祝大涌泉镇恢复远程通讯！", "name": "乌露露"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也为了庆祝安洁莉娜、塔妮、嘉辛塔、阿梅利亚顺利从南境回归！", "name": "乌露露"}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大涌泉镇现在特开展冰淇淋免费派送活动！最新研发的胡萝卜筒冰淇淋，将在整个大涌泉镇免费派送！", "name": "乌露露"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大家一定好奇，冰淇淋该如何免费派送对不对？", "name": "乌露露"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "让我们欢迎来自罗德岛的源石技艺大师，操纵重力的——安洁莉娜！安心院安洁莉娜小姐！", "name": "乌露露"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "true", "pfrom": "50,0", "pto": "50,0", "name": "avg_npc_2347_1#8$1", "duration": 0.0}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "然后......在颠倒的重力之下——为胡萝卜筒冰淇淋——欢呼吧！", "name": "乌露露"}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$p_imp_funnel_end_h"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "clear": "true", "tsfrom": "1,1", "tsto": "0,1", "tsduration": 0.5}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#13$1"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "说得那么大张旗鼓，可我们只有这么一箱啊......", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#13$1"}, {"id": 270, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2"}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗐，怕什么，话都说出去了，先上再说！再等下去，温泉的热气都要渗到冰淇淋箱里了！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2"}, {"id": 272, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "安洁莉娜！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2"}, {"id": 273, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好嘞！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2"}, {"id": 276, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "76_i15_2", "fadetime": 0.0, "xScale": 1.1, "yScale": 1.1, "screenadapt": "coverall", "x": 0.0}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_76_i15_1", "style": "cg", "layer": 1.0, "sfrom": 1.0, "sto": 1.1, "sduration": 0.0}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$chill_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "安洁莉娜打开手中的保温箱——"}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 5.0, "ystrength": 2.0, "vibrato": 10.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_cuteappear"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_76_i15_4", "style": "cg", "layer": 1.0, "sfrom": 0.9, "sto": 1.1, "sduration": 0.5}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "胡萝卜筒冰淇淋一个又一个地从箱里飞出，在温泉氤氲的蒸汽中蹦跳起来。"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_jump_water", "volume": 0.9}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_shuihua", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 1.0, "g": 1.0, "b": 1.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "76_i15_1", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.1, "yScale": 1.1}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.1, "yScaleFrom": 1.1, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "duration": 30.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在冰淇淋的诱惑之下，长耳朵的卡特斯情不自禁地跳入温泉之中。"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "短耳朵的卡特斯原本也想下水，却发觉身旁的阿纳缇拿在手里的冰淇淋被什么小东西叼走了——"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸？为什么你的“小飞虫”会抢你的冰淇淋？", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那个不是“小飞虫”，那个是——呃，很难解释啊，呜......", "name": "阿梅利亚"}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸，不是“小飞虫”吗？我一直以为那个是羽兽形态的重装小飞虫，你的终极武器之类的......", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不好解释就先放一放！来，我手头的这个冰淇淋给你！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而之前被乌露露的超大音量广播震回家里的镇民，还有来疗养的感染者们，也纷纷从为了隔音紧闭的门扉里探出头来，而后飞奔出门。"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "玛蒂娜，不一起来吗？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我的口味和你比较像，对胡萝卜没那么感冒——你也是因为这个才主动要求来当派送员的吧？", "name": "玛蒂娜"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘿嘿......", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要是一撮毛也在这里就好了。让它帮忙派送冰淇淋，说不定能让更多人真正认识这种可爱的生物......", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "说到有袋鼷兽，你知道那个有袋鼷兽被人敲了脑袋，结果长出绒毛躲去南境的故事吗？", "name": "玛蒂娜"}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，塔妮跟我讲过。", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这个故事还有下半截，你知道吗？", "name": "玛蒂娜"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "下半截？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "据说在很久很久之后，在说出口的话会在转瞬之间到达千里之外，人们已经忘却了什么叫说不出口的时候......", "name": "玛蒂娜"}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "会有一只有袋鼷兽离开它们代代居住的南境。", "name": "玛蒂娜"}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它无论如何都想重新学会阅读和聆听，因此，它会寻找一位与多年前那个雷姆必拓人同样勇敢的信使。", "name": "玛蒂娜"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一人一兽会重新踏上旅途，但这次不是为了传信，而是传递那些被又多又杂乱的话语蒙蔽的，真正的心意......", "name": "玛蒂娜"}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "难道您是想说，一撮毛就是那只有袋鼷兽？可它现在已经回到了南境，和它的爸爸妈妈团聚了呀。", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......这个故事该不是您现编出来逗我开心的吧？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈，故事总有添油加醋的成分，可谁又能说故事背后一定没有一个真实的原型呢？", "name": "玛蒂娜"}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真是的......", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "与其纠结故事的真伪，不如先享受这一刻吧。我给你拍个照片！来，笑一个——", "name": "玛蒂娜"}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_screenshot", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$skill_flash", "volume": 0.9}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "76_i15_1", "fadetime": 0.5, "xScale": 1.01, "yScale": 1.01, "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_76_i16_6", "style": "cg", "layer": 1.0, "sfrom": 0.95, "sto": 0.9, "sduration": 0.3, "rfrom": 0.0, "rto": 5.0, "rduration": 0.3}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "imagerotate", "attributes": {"angle": 5.0, "fadetime": 0.3, "inverse": "true"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.5, "keep": "true", "initamount": 0.0, "amount": 0.2, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的，博士，就是这样一趟愉快的旅途。"}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不光是这张照片承载的场景，也不光是前面的文字记叙的欢乐。"}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "每一次重逢都让人感到温暖，每一次再见都指向新的可能。"}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哪怕离别仍然近在眼前——"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——不，请别误会，我说的是，玛蒂娜婉拒了来罗德岛的邀请......"}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "imagerotate", "attributes": {"angle": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "inverse": "true"}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_desert_1", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她给我看了一封没有收件人，也没有寄件人的信。"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她说，和我共同走过这段旅途之后，她忽然又生出了一些额外的勇气，去解决这个困扰她许久的问题......"}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......于是，她在离开雷姆必拓之后，在荒地上告别了我们。"}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在那之后，我们又解决了一些问题。"}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿梅利亚和嘉辛塔敲定了拉特兰作为创业的起点，跟他们的枢机聊了一整个下午。"}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔妮一路勘测地形，已经为大涌泉镇的镇民找好了三四处潜在可移居的地点，唯一的问题是这些地方好像都在公认的雷姆必拓境外。"}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "gridbg", "attributes": {"imagegroup": "53_g16_sunnyday_L1/53_g16_sunnyday_R1/53_g16_sunnyday_L2/53_g16_sunnyday_R2", "solidwidth": "1280/1280/1280/1280", "solidheight": "720/720/720/720", "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "largebgtween", "attributes": {"duration": 30.0, "yFrom": 300.0, "yTo": 250.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "backgroundTween", "attributes": {"duration": 15.0, "yTo": 0.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而我......我想了很多很多事情。"}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "已经发生的，正在发生的，尚未发生的......"}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "许多事情我还想不清楚，但唯独在那封信中向玛蒂娜提出的问题，我已经有了答案。"}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我是罗德岛的信使安洁莉娜。"}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在你需要我的时候，我会像你当时为我伸出援助之手一样，坚定地站在你的身边。"}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呼......"}}, {"id": 366, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......想说的话还有很多，但这张信纸已经被我写满，连个落款的地方都没有了。"}}, {"id": 367, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但是没关系。"}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "从我想说的话挤满了信纸，再也写不下一个字的那一刻起——"}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——我就会向你飞奔而来。"}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "gridbg", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 376, "prop": "Decision", "attributes": {"options": "那么......", "values": "1"}, "targetLine": {"option1": "line377"}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "Predicate", "attributes": {"references": "1"}, "endOfOpt": false}, {"id": 378, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 380, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_072cg_dawn", "layer": 2.0, "x": 100.0, "y": 0.0}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "76_i14", "xScale": 1.2, "yScale": 1.2, "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 383, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "duration": 60.0}}, {"id": 384, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明媚的日光下，信使的朋友们好奇地看向你。"}}, {"id": 386, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一路上，她们已经从安洁莉娜的口中听过你的许多事迹。"}}, {"id": 387, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不光是在晶簇前消沉的她，还有在南境的帐篷里努力入睡的她，看着地图计算距离的她，在归途的风中哼歌的她......"}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她总会不经意地提起你，在三人心中激起一次又一次想象。"}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而今，你终于站在了她们面前。"}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这位耳朵短短的卡特斯是塔妮，她是大涌泉镇的探路者，是个了不起的探险家！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 391, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这位耳朵长长的卡特斯是嘉辛塔，这位阿纳缇是阿梅利亚！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿梅利亚是很厉害的通讯技术专家，梦想是连接整片大地，而嘉辛塔是她的投资人！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 393, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "各位，这位就是博士，罗德岛的博士！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 394, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你微笑着对着她们点头致意。"}}, {"id": 395, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就算隔着兜帽，她们显然也感受到了你的善意，就连最容易紧张的阿梅利亚也明显松弛下来。"}}, {"id": 396, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "介绍完后，从旅途归来的信使送给你一个笑容......"}}, {"id": 397, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一个你之前未在那张脸上见过的，比日光还要灿烂的笑容。"}}, {"id": 398, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 399, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 400, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "博士，我回来了！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 401, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 402, "prop": "Decision", "attributes": {"options": "欢迎回来，安洁莉娜。", "values": "1"}, "targetLine": {"option1": "line403"}}, {"id": 403, "prop": "Predicate", "attributes": {"references": "1"}, "endOfOpt": false}, {"id": 404, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 405, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 406, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 407, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 408, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 409, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 410, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 411, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}